# App-only repository.
# GitHub Pages serves this repo's root, so we track ONLY the deployed app, the
# custom-domain file, and repo hygiene. Everything else — local dev scaffolding
# (CLAUDE.md, .claude/, tools/, BACKLOG.md, CHANGELOG.md, docs/, Design Files/)
# and the versioned working archives (Watchpoint_v*.html) — stays local.
# Version history lives in git tags + GitHub Releases.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/index.html
!/CNAME
!/README.md
